[{"knowledge_point": {"db_id": 17592186119815, "id": "f892805c-2c2c-5105-91ba-353aefe7b7f2", "title": "Finding a Basis of the Space Spanned by a Set of Vectors Using Inspection"}, "question": {":question/id": "b0cb4140-681a-5fd2-8505-5c0f6893f751", ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind bases of $S=\\operatorname{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3\\}$ by inspection. **Select every set that is a basis of $S$.**", ":question/worked-solution": "A **basis** must be linearly independent and span $S$.\n\nIf $\\mathbf{a}_{2}=t\\mathbf{a}_{3}$, coordinate $1$ would force $t=0$. But coordinate $2$ would then give $(0)(0)=0\\ne 1$. Thus these two nonzero vectors are not parallel and are linearly independent.\n\nTo have $\\mathbf{a}_{1}=x\\mathbf{a}_{3}+y\\mathbf{a}_{2}$, coordinates $1$ and $2$ force $x=2$ and $y=0$. The remaining coordinate would have to be $(2)(2)+(0)(2)=4$; the displayed value is $4$.\n\nChecking the proposed combination gives\n\n$$\n(2)\\mathbf{a}_{3}+(0)\\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{a}_{1}.\n$$\n\nRemoving $\\mathbf{a}_{1}$ leaves the span unchanged. The parallel pair $\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$ is dependent. Pairing either nonzero vector on that line with $\\mathbf{a}_{2}$ gives an independent spanning pair. No singleton spans the two independent directions, and the triple is dependent.\n\nTherefore, select exactly these bases:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal{B}_{1}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{2}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$", ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard", ":question/answer-fields": [{":answer-field/id": "b902f06a-030b-5110-8061-f181bff358d2", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "bfe8b4ee-18a8-58ff-98fd-6417e03851fc", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "848b9cb3-7781-5b1e-8cdc-3c9901cf5b47", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "bfe8b4ee-18a8-58ff-98fd-6417e03851fc"]}, {":answer-field/id": "775436a3-33fd-566e-81ac-6c88ef9a6dee", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "feeaedcb-d34e-5fde-9424-05fe586cc7c2", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "b2841d11-39b3-5788-9662-95642c83bfc7", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "b2841d11-39b3-5788-9662-95642c83bfc7"]}, {":answer-field/id": "f0dadc8f-9c32-54c7-86e1-dc378c695800", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "c0d08c3f-239f-5cdb-9b82-2e8f7218ba48", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "a35dcbd5-2fcc-5a56-b05d-655a44fbe690", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "c0d08c3f-239f-5cdb-9b82-2e8f7218ba48"]}, {":answer-field/id": "ee1ed042-05e9-5cd9-8712-c20ba130fb19", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "6d9e3fd4-8e9d-529e-911b-6872e7945142", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "31092c18-d41a-57d2-a2d9-ff9bf3bcb710", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "31092c18-d41a-57d2-a2d9-ff9bf3bcb710"]}, {":answer-field/id": "b32caa94-366a-5106-a2c1-625230804753", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "1ccc06ab-847d-5066-b36e-ea0f6984db0a", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "3108f956-1c29-5f08-b66c-3bfb099cf31d", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "1ccc06ab-847d-5066-b36e-ea0f6984db0a"]}, {":answer-field/id": "571b889a-ee8a-5f30-bc5b-4dee26ae180e", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "776d666d-b74a-5965-9225-6d9274c319df", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "2b2df00a-5bac-5ac3-849c-02108756978e", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "776d666d-b74a-5965-9225-6d9274c319df"]}, {":answer-field/id": "be8b4aaf-9d91-584e-9c30-272bbc498d2a", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "8e5f7041-06dc-508c-a5e0-143a3a936040", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "acb9bde4-5c71-5f12-a38f-fe91fb996c87", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "8e5f7041-06dc-508c-a5e0-143a3a936040"]}]}, "generation": {"version": "basis-inspection-1", "template": "inspection-hard", "parameters": {"band": "hard", "case": "multiple", "vectors": [[2, 0, 4], [0, 1, 2], [1, 0, 2]], "roles": [2, 1, 0], "coordinates": [0, 1, 2], "line_coefficients": [null, null, null], "a": 2, "b": 0, "delta": 0, "p": 2, "q": 2}, "source_question_ids": ["51c289e1-f118-5444-bf1d-c7e8262c549f", "a861accd-0de4-505d-8847-8b30f8b4e546"], "prerequisite_question_ids": ["7b28b42f-0ac4-543e-b