academy-tex-v1", "checkbox_selection_policy": "nonempty-checkbox-v1"}}, {"knowledge_point": {"db_id": 17592186119815, "id": "f892805c-2c2c-5105-91ba-353aefe7b7f2", "title": "Finding a Basis of the Space Spanned by a Set of Vectors Using Inspection"}, "question": {":question/id": "ca6fe80f-1e87-520e-9026-8f14a41c5f70", ":question/problem": "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind bases of $S=\\operatorname{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3\\}$ by inspection. **Select every set that is a basis of $S$.**", ":question/worked-solution": "A **basis** must be linearly independent and span $S$.\n\nIf $\\mathbf{a}_{2}=t\\mathbf{a}_{1}$, coordinate $1$ would force $t=0$. But coordinate $2$ would then give $(0)(0)=0\\ne 1$. Thus these two nonzero vectors are not parallel and are linearly independent.\n\nTo have $\\mathbf{a}_{3}=x\\mathbf{a}_{1}+y\\mathbf{a}_{2}$, coordinates $1$ and $2$ force $x=-1$ and $y=1$. The remaining coordinate would have to be $(-1)(2)+(1)(2)=0$; the displayed value is $0$.\n\nChecking the proposed combination gives\n\n$$\n(-1)\\mathbf{a}_{1}+(1)\\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{a}_{3}.\n$$\n\nRemoving $\\mathbf{a}_{3}$ leaves the span unchanged. Both coefficients are nonzero. Each of the three pairs is independent: if the combination were parallel to either original direction, the nonzero coefficient of the other independent direction would have to vanish. Each pair also recovers the omitted vector by rearranging the displayed relation. No singleton spans the two independent directions, and the triple is dependent.\n\nTherefore, select exactly these bases:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal{B}_{1}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{2}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{3}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$", ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard", ":question/answer-fields": [{":answer-field/id": "286e9400-63a3-50e9-9e05-43d50d7bfbfc", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "30feb23a-f3d3-549a-93b4-08f120951005", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "536d2f6d-5fc4-5e49-bef6-50fb625ee7e9", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "536d2f6d-5fc4-5e49-bef6-50fb625ee7e9"]}, {":answer-field/id": "08dc6549-cada-58b4-8dea-ada466c5344d", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "3773e95a-c629-5dbb-b5f1-59d713a1521e", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "e60f419e-ef32-52e4-9817-576ef4cb2476", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "e60f419e-ef32-52e4-9817-576ef4cb2476"]}, {":answer-field/id": "0a64ae15-e35b-5415-a0f9-db1406e2930b", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "1f3b4cec-baf7-55ad-9832-1a10b62cbea3", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "false"}, {":answer/id": "6d7e4381-dafd-5b48-930f-bfbc2a580aa6", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answer/value": "true"}], ":answer-field/correct": [":answer/id", "1f3b4cec-baf7-55ad-9832-1a10b62cbea3"]}, {":answer-field/id": "5c252778-b554-53d1-b779-5a216021e65c", ":answer-field/key": "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$", ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox", ":answer-field/choices": [{":answer/id": "056adbb9-e812-5a8f-aa42-255718061a93", ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text", ":answ